{
  "identifier": "geonames-semantic-web",
  "title": "GeoNames Semantic Web",
  "description": {
    "en": "The GeoNames Ontology makes it possible to add geospatial semantic information to the Word Wide Web. All over 6.2 million geonames toponyms now have a unique URL with a corresponding RDF web service. Other services describe the relation between toponyms.\r\n\r\nSPARQL endpoints for this data are made available by third parties. [Geonames at Kasabi](http://kasabi.com/dataset/geonames/), and [FactForge](http://factforge.net/sparql) has it loaded as well."
  },
